                                "sense_id": "2383503a-48b4-3c19-b357-581b984a30e3",
                                "text": "Here we have the ninth number of the fourth volume of a journal devoted to the great and noble art of Bicyclism. A modern art, unknown utterly to our forefathers, it has sprung into existence with intense velocity […]"
